1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:03,427
(Sheldon:)Uh-huh. And if I don't want to forfeit
the award?

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,260
(Sheldon:)Well, you've got that tied up
in a neat little bow.

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:10,270
(Sheldon:)All right, thank you.

4
00:00:10,892 --> 00:00:12,972
(Sheldon:)-Problem.
-What?

5
00:00:13,686 --> 00:00:15,976
(Sheldon:)They expect me to give a speech
at the banquet.

6
00:00:16,189 --> 00:00:17,439
(Sheldon:)I can't give a speech.

7
00:00:17,607 --> 00:00:22,107
(Howard:)Well, no, you're mistaken.
You give speeches all the time.

8
00:00:24,238 --> 00:00:27,448
(Howard:)What you can't do is shut up.

9
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:30,491
(Raj:)Yeah, before the movie,
you did 20 minutes...

10
00:00:30,703 --> 00:00:33,123
(Raj:)...on why guacamole turns brown.

11
00:00:33,497 --> 00:00:35,957
(Raj:)Turned brown
while you were talking.

12
00:00:36,584 --> 00:00:39,124
I'm perfectly comfortable speaking
to small groups.

13
00:00:39,295 --> 00:00:41,425
(Sheldon:)I cannot speak to large crowds.

14
00:00:41,589 --> 00:00:42,969
(Leonard:)What to you is a large crowd?

15
00:00:43,132 --> 00:00:45,302
(Sheldon:)Any group big enough
to trample me to death.

16
00:00:46,469 --> 00:00:50,769
(Sheldon:)General rule of thumb is 36 adults
or 70 children.

17
00:00:51,474 --> 00:00:53,934
(Penny:)Sheldon. Congratulations.

18
00:00:54,101 --> 00:00:55,771
(Penny:)Brought you cheesecake from work.

19
00:00:55,937 --> 00:01:02,027
You know, because of your award,
not because that busboy sneezed on it.

